cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Metadata Extraction and JSON Export Pipeline for LAGE Sequencing Data"
abstract: >
  A modular, open-source Python pipeline for automated extraction,
  normalisation, and FAIR-compliant packaging of sequencing metadata.
  The pipeline supports content-based file detection across eleven
  instrument-native formats, sample lineage reconstruction, and
  RO-Crate 1.2 dataset packaging serialised in JSON-LD.
